XT:\nWork in {project_root} on {date}. V716 finished with six executed primaries, one separate pre-gate record and seven absent producer primaries. Exp8290 localized CUDA error 101 below the model but did not prove its root cause. Exp8291 qualified constructed dependency mechanics only. V717 tests a bounded changed mechanism on exposed cached development data; no independent generalization claim.\nEXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:\nCLAUDE.md; CODEX.md; ops/e2e-test-plan.md; ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml; openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md; openspec/capabilities/verification/spec.md; scripts/experiment_template.py; python/carnot/reporting/primary_publication.py; openspec/change-proposals/research-roadmap-vNEXT.md; python/carnot/reporting/roadmap_contract.py; results/experiment_8303_v716_capstone.json; results/experiment_7996_v693_sparse_energy_training.json; results/experiment_7998_v693_selective_feedback_learning.json; research-references.md; research-studying.md\nTASK:\nBind fourteen tasks and freeze the changed local-learning question. Deliver results/experiment_8304_v717_contract_methods.json. Create the thin runner scripts/experiments/experiment_8304_v717_contract_methods.py. Store primitive evidence under results/raw/experiment_8304_v717_contract_methods/. Read current upstream tasks by their exact declared deliverables; paths not yet produced are dependencies, not historical files.\nCONCRETE STEPS:\n1. PRECONDITIONS: Emit a flushed start line. Authenticate input bytes and terminal/adversarial sidecars. Check private scratch, tools and required resources before measurement. Missing external operands produce complete_blocked_<operand>, verdict_class=blocked and exact gate_check_summary; never substitute simulated observations.\n2. Emit a flushed progress line at every phase boundary and before and after every model load, generation, benchmark and subprocess. Print completed/pending counts inside long loops and a heartbeat at least every 60 seconds while children run; keep every gap below 600 seconds. Use unbuffered output, deadlines and owned process-group cleanup. Write any file over about 200 lines in several tool calls of at most about 150 lines, with a progress message between calls. Split commands and file creation into resumable batches; no single huge tool call and no padded runtime.\n3. Spec first: add relevant REQ-* and SCENARIO-* before implementation. Write focused failing tests first. Preserve existing tests, validators and historical primary bytes. Reuse existing numeric and reporting modules through small adapters. Freeze owned validation argv and private fixture paths. Scratch belongs in /tmp; real runners in scripts/experiments/. No generator-weight updates or external publication.\n4. Use no_model_load, inference_substrate=aggregation_from_upstream_artifacts, MODEL_SPECS=[] and zero current LLM calls. Compare the staged YAML, visible task table and complete JSON contract for Exp8304 through Exp8317; bind activated authority only when the conductor has activated V717. Never mutate the active roadmap.\n5. Read the V717 research-reference section and the primary methods for SURE-RAG 2605.03534v2, online KAN 2602.02056v4 and constraint refinement 2509.24489. Reuse cached full text or make a bounded low-concurrency source check. Write docs/research-notes/v717-method-ingestion.md with methods, failure boundaries and the distinction from Exp7426/7427 and Exp7996/7998. Update research-studying.md with actual ingestion status.\n6. Freeze openspec/change-proposals/v717-local-learning-protocol.json from the design's scientific contract BEFORE opening any new outcome analysis. Bind the existing V707 source roster, four local sentence features, immutable human-label authority, 34-parameter spline and RBF arms, linear and scalar controls, optimizer, tune halves, source ordering, delay8, learning rate0.01, H1/H2 alpha=.025, intended128 reserved slots and stream96/retention32. A support failure does not authorize alternate cohorts or relaxed thresholds.\n7. Authenticate V716 dispositions from current primaries and conductor pre-gate receipts; research-complete.yaml lags through V715 at planning. Keep absent producer verdicts absent. Preserve V713 intervention protocol as unmeasured and parked; the sole V717 live canary cannot reopen its full downstream suite.\n8. Freeze reusable validation and child deadlines in a separate execution manifest; owned code must have real tests, not a contract checkbox. Set current_contract_ready_score=1 only on exact fourteen-task agreement and passing owned checks. Set protocol_ready_score=1 only on immutable choices and valid source references; neither field depends on CUDA or benefit.\n9. Run applicable E2E-018 private authority lifecycle. Run the specified private E2E checks from ops/e2e-test-plan.md and relevant unit/consumer tests. Require 100 percent newly owned statement coverage including real CLI, child, failure and recovery paths. Run scoped Ruff check/format, strict mypy and scripts/check_spec_coverage.py --files <owned-test-files>. Keep exact argv, exit codes, clocks and output hashes. Use pytest -n 0 -o addopts= with private scratch. Do not launch the full repository test suite inside this bounded experiment.\n10. Cold-replay primitive rows in a fresh process, including valid, negative and rehashed-tamper controls. Validate a private candidate with unchanged primary_publication checks, scripts/adversarial_verify.py --json <private-candidate> and scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py --strict <private-candidate>. Publish the terminal primary atomically after normal completion and required checks. Failed owned checks disqualify and set readiness to zero. External incompleteness is blocked, not partial. Reconcile openspec/, _bmad/traceability.md, ops/status.md and ops/changelog.md. Do not modify research-roadmap.yaml.\nREQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS:\nexperiment_id, task_id, milestone, run_date: principle: Identify the actual invocation and its execution authority.\nhonest_verdict, verdict_class: principle: Terminal honest_verdict starts complete_; verdict_class is positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial. Partial is only retryable unfinished owned work, never an unchanged external block.\ngate_check_summary: principle: Every block names the upstream, actual path/hash, exact field, operator, expected and observed values; absent evidence differs from measured zero.\ninference_substrate, inference_substrate_class, MODEL_SPECS, model_invocation_counts, historical_model_provenance: principle: Separate current model execution from imported observations; do not apply a generation floor to cached scoring.\nrows, intended_count, completed_count, failed_count, censored_count, excluded_count, independent_count, sample_size_budget: principle: Preserve every intended source/condition/arm with numerator and denominator; repetitions are not independent samples.\nverifier_is_oracle, exposure_scope, independent_generalization_score, generalized_learning_benefit_score: principle: Oracle-defined success is circular_positive. Reused cohorts are exposed development; both generalization scores stay zero.\nrequired_checks_passed, flagged_adversarial, acceptance_gates, validation_receipts, terminal_validation_sidecar_path: principle: Readiness requires owned checks and byte-bound validation; it does not require a scientific win.\npreconditions_checked, duration_s, phase_spans, random_seed, reproducibility_checksum, source_artifact_hashes, code_config_hashes, raw_shard_hashes: principle: Bind conclusions to measured work, configuration and replayable evidence.\ncited_upstream_artifacts, field_principles: principle: Name imported fields and hashes and explain every added field's evidentiary purpose.\ncurrent_contract_ready_score, protocol_ready_score, canonical_tasks_sha256, authority_snapshots, protocol_path, protocol_sha256: principle: Provide exact upstream fields and reproducible staged-versus-activated authority.\nmethod_mapping, prior_null_differences, parked_v713_chain: principle: A paper citation or a new milestone name does not justify repeating an unchanged failed mechanism.\nRun command: cd {project_root} && PYTHONPATH=python:. PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 .venv/bin/python -u scripts/experiments/experiment_8304_v717_contract_methods.py --date {date}\nDo NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.", "model": "opus"}, {"id": "exp8305-cached-sentence-custody", "title": "Reconstruct source-disjoint sentence features from existing live receipts", "phase": 1, "track": "data", "priority": "high", "requires_gpu": false, "max_turns": 50, "estimated_wall_time_min": 50, "per_unit_rows": true, "milestone": "2026.10.717", "deliverable": "results/experiment_8305_v717_cached_sentence_custody.json", "inference_substrate_class": "no_model_load", "MODEL_SPECS": [], "gated_on": [{"upstream": "exp8304-contract-methods", "artifact_field": "protocol_ready_score", "op": "==", "value": 1}], "prior_failures": [{"experiment_id": "exp8184-reserved-sentence-capture", "verdict": "complete_null_reserved_sentence_capture", "addressed_by": "Reconstruct immutable already captured rows, preserving all 31 unavailable reserved slots; do not make new calls or reinterpret missing capture as a negative label.", "retire_if_same_verdict": true}], "prompt": "CONTEXT:\nWork in {project_root} on {date}. V716 finished with six executed primaries, one separate pre-gate record and seven absent producer primaries. Exp8290 localized CUDA error 101 below the model but did not prove its root cause. Exp8291 qualified constructed dependency mechanics only. V717 tests a bounded changed mechanism on exposed cached development data; no independent generalization claim.\nEXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:\nCLAUDE.md; CODEX.md; ops/e2e-test-plan.md; ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml; openspec/capabilities/research-reporting/spec.md; openspec/capabilities/verification/spec.md; scripts/experiment_template.py; python/carnot/reporting/primary_publication.py; openspec/change-proposals/research-roadmap-vNEXT.md; results/experiment_8182_v707_fit_sentence_capture.json; results/experiment_8184_v707_reserved_sentence_capture.json; python/carnot/verify/sentence_evidence_8166.py; python/carnot/verify/sentence_transport_8179.py; python/carnot/verify/sentence_labels_7942.py; openspec/change-proposals/v707-sentence-transport-protocol.json\nTASK:\nReconstruct source-disjoint sentence features from existing live receipts. Deliver results/experiment_8305_v717_cached_sentence_custody.json. Create the thin runner scripts/experiments/experiment_8305_v717_cached_sentence_custody.py. Store primitive evidence under results/raw/experiment_8305_v717_cached_sentence_custody/. Read current upstream tasks by their exact declared deliverables; paths not yet produced are dependencies, not historical files.\nCONCRETE STEPS:\n1. PRECONDITIONS: Emit a flushed start line. Authenticate input bytes and terminal/adversarial sidecars. Check private scratch, tools and required resources before measurement. Missing external operands produce complete_blocked_<operand>, verdict_class=blocked and exact gate_check_summary; never substitute simulated observations.\n2. Emit a flushed progress line at every phase boundary and before and after every model load, generation, benchmark and subprocess. Print completed/pending counts inside long loops and a heartbeat at least every 60 seconds while children run; keep every gap below 600 seconds. Use unbuffered output, deadlines and owned process-group cleanup. Write any file over about 200 lines in several tool calls of at most about 150 lines, with a progress message between calls. Split commands and file creation into resumable batches; no single huge tool call and no padded runtime.\n3. Spec first: add relevant REQ-* and SCENARIO-* before implementation. Write focused failing tests first. Preserve existing tests, validators and historical primary bytes. Reuse existing numeric and reporting modules through small adapters. Freeze owned validation argv and private fixture paths. Scratch belongs in /tmp; real runners in scripts/experiments/. No generator-weight updates or external publication.\n4. Declare no_model_load, inference_substrate=verifier_ensemble_against_cached_candidates, MODEL_SPECS=[] and zero current model calls. Record historical unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF receipts, model hashes and actual original GPU provenance separately.\n5. Authenticate Exp8182/8184 primary and terminal/adversarial sidecars, then reconstruct the 16-dimensional source rows from bound primitive replies and public source bytes. Keep y in a separately protected evaluator shard. Model-generated sentence relations are features, never y. The existing response-level human target is binary; do not manufacture three-way truth labels.\n6. Retain exactly fit128/tune64/reserved128 source-cluster IDs and their original order. Split tune into the first32 calibration and next32 comparator-selection slots; stream96/retention32 follow the bound V707 roster. Record all missing/failed/excluded slots without substitution. Distinguish188/192 completed transport rows from158 feature rows and157 labeled fit/tune rows:104 fit,25 calibration and28 comparator-selection. Reserved has97/128 feature rows; stream1..96 has74, later9..96 has67 (32 supported/35 unsupported), retention97..128 has23 (9 supported/14 unsupported). Reconstruct these counts independently, never manufacture quotas.\n7. Emit fit/tune predictor-only shards and separate evaluator shards. Reserved predictor shard must exclude y, nested historical_paired_control targets and all label-derived fields. Freeze hashes before any downstream reader opens it; prohibit joins on gold labels. Verify both source/answer hashes, source-group disjointness, model identity and finite features.\n8. Use x[0] as the holistic-logit input with a static-trained slope frozen online and x[12:16] as local unsupported mean/max, contradicted fraction and baseless fraction. Freeze exact feature names/indices and [0,1] bounds. Reject identity features. Structural canaries must catch target injection, source-role collision and changed reply bytes.\n9. Set cached_cohort_ready_score=1 for exact reconstruction and source custody even if support is insufficient. Set fit_support_ready_score=1 only with >=96 usable fit sources and >=12 of each label, and >=24 usable plus >=4 of each label in EACH tune half. Write docs/research-notes/v717-cached-cohort.md describing the exposed-development scope and missingness.\n10. Run applicable E2E-015 and E2E-019 private source/label CLIs. Run the specified private E2E checks from ops/e2e-test-plan.md and relevant unit/consumer tests. Require 100 percent newly owned statement coverage including real CLI, child, failure and recovery paths. Run scoped Ruff check/format, strict mypy and scripts/check_spec_coverage.py --files <owned-test-files>. Keep exact argv, exit codes, clocks and output hashes. Use pytest -n 0 -o addopts= with private scratch. Do not launch the full repository test suite inside this bounded experiment.\n11. Cold-replay primitive rows in a fresh process, including valid, negative and rehashed-tamper controls. Validate a private candidate with unchanged primary_publication checks, scripts/adversarial_verify.py --json <private-candidate> and scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py --strict <private-candidate>. Publish the terminal primary atomically after normal completion and required checks. Failed owned checks disqualify and set readiness to zero. External incompleteness is blocked, not partial. Reconcile openspec/, _bmad/traceability.md, ops/status.md and ops/changelog.md. Do not modify research-roadmap.yaml.\nREQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS:\nexperiment_id, task_id, milestone, run_date: principle: Identify the actual invocation and its execution authority.\nhonest_verdict, verdict_class: principle: Terminal honest_verdict starts complete_; verdict_class is positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial. Partial is only retryable unfinished owned work, never an unchanged external block.\ngate_check_summary: principle: Every block names the upstream, actual path/hash, exact field, operator, expected and observed values; absent evidence differs from measured zero.\ninference_substrate, inference_substrate_class, MODEL_SPECS, model_invocation_counts, historical_model_provenance: principle: Separate current model execution from imported observations; do not apply a generation floor to cached scoring.\nrows, intended_count, completed_count, failed_count, censored_count, excluded_count, independent_count, sample_size_budget: principle: Preserve every intended source/condition/arm with numerator and denominator; repetitions are not independent samples.\nverifier_is_oracle, exposure_scope, independent_generalization_score, generalized_learning_benefit_score: principle: Oracle-defined success is circular_positive. Reused cohorts are exposed development; both generalization scores stay zero.\nrequired_checks_passed, flagged_adversarial, acceptance_gates, validation_receipts, terminal_validation_sidecar_path: principle: Readiness requires owned checks and byte-bound validation; it does not require a scientific win.\npreconditions_checked, duration_s, phase_spans, random_seed, reproducibility_checksum, source_artifact_hashes, code_config_hashes, raw_shard_hashes: principle: Bind conclusions to measured work, configuration and replayable evidence.\ncited_upstream_artifacts, field_principles: principle: Name imported fields and hashes and explain every added field's evidentiary purpose.\ncached_cohort_ready_score, fit_support_ready_score, predictor_shards, evaluator_shards, source_role_manifest, feature_schema: principle: Distinguish authenticated custody from sufficient data and keep targets out of prediction paths.\nhistorical_capture_counts, class_support_by_role, missing_source_rows, exposure_ledger: principl