mentation. Write focused failing tests first. Preserve existing tests, validators and historical primary bytes. Reuse existing numeric and reporting modules through small adapters. Freeze owned validation argv and private fixture paths. Scratch belongs in /tmp; real runners in scripts/experiments/. No generator-weight updates or external publication.\n4. Declare no_model_load, inference_substrate=aggregation_from_upstream_artifacts and MODEL_SPECS=[]. Reconstruct the issued trajectory, updates and checkpoint states independently. Do not import the learner's claimed gains. Read retention targets only in evaluator processes after all four shadow windows are sealed. Exp8311 may already have read these targets after the same seal; disclose that prior evaluator exposure. The learner must never receive them.\n5. H2 primary is intended-slot cost(frozen_spline)-cost(online_sparse) on stream slots9..96, including missing-feature escalations. Use10000 moving-block bootstrap resamples, block length8, seed7178312, nominal one-sided97.5 percent lower bound. State explicitly that fixed exposed trajectory intervals are descriptive and do not establish an IID or conformal guarantee.\n6. Report every arm on the same88 later slots, Brier, wrong-accept rate, coverage, later distinct-source probability/action changes and exact dense/sparse parity. Require >=64 qualified later sources, >=8 per label, real admitted updates, working exact-step-budget and typed-action controls, reachable margins under the actual update rule, and positive action-oracle headroom for an informative utility null. If action changes are unreachable under the fixed update budget, report complete_null_update_budget_no_headroom and limit the retirement to that update rule. No changed actions is a meaningful no-utility result when the full support/reachability conditions hold; parameter motion is not benefit.\n7. A development learning signal requires mean gain>=.02 and lower bound>0 against frozen_spline, plus final retention mean cost degradation<=.02 and Brier degradation<=.01 on all available retention labels; require >=20 qualified retention sources and >=4 per label. The frozen panel has23 qualified sources,9 supported/14 unsupported; report this small exploratory panel and all9 missing slots without replacement. Show all windows0/32/64/96 and all missing bounds, without selecting a favorable window. Compare calibration_only descriptively; a win only over frozen does not establish locality-specific advantage.\n8. Prove future-label invariance, duplicate/stale rejection, source separation and restart parity from primitives. Recompute one real update in a scalar reference and verify later-source attribution by substituting the before-update state. No claim of generalized learning or newly learned hard constraints.\n9. Set learning_audit_ready_score for a valid reduction regardless of H2 outcome. Use complete_null_delayed_decision_benefit if supported and no gain, complete_null_insufficient_support if underpowered, blocked for absent external input, disqualified for failed owned checks. Retire the exact four-feature/fixed-knot/.01-update combination if its prior failure verdict repeats; record all mechanism limits.\n10. Run applicable E2E-020 and E2E-021 private replay cases. Run the specified private E2E checks from ops/e2e-test-plan.md and relevant unit/consumer tests. Require 100 percent newly owned statement coverage including real CLI, child, failure and recovery paths. Run scoped Ruff check/format, strict mypy and scripts/check_spec_coverage.py --files <owned-test-files>. Keep exact argv, exit codes, clocks and output hashes. Use pytest -n 0 -o addopts= with private scratch. Do not launch the full repository test suite inside this bounded experiment.\n11. Cold-replay primitive rows in a fresh process, including valid, negative and rehashed-tamper controls. Validate a private candidate with unchanged primary_publication checks, scripts/adversarial_verify.py --json <private-candidate> and scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py --strict <private-candidate>. Publish the terminal primary atomically after normal completion and required checks. Failed owned checks disqualify and set readiness to zero. External incompleteness is blocked, not partial. Reconcile openspec/, _bmad/traceability.md, ops/status.md and ops/changelog.md. Do not modify research-roadmap.yaml.\nREQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS:\nexperiment_id, task_id, milestone, run_date: principle: Identify the actual invocation and its execution authority.\nhonest_verdict, verdict_class: principle: Terminal honest_verdict starts complete_; verdict_class is positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial. Partial is only retryable unfinished owned work, never an unchanged external block.\ngate_check_summary: principle: Every block names the upstream, actual path/hash, exact field, operator, expected and observed values; absent evidence differs from measured zero.\ninference_substrate, inference_substrate_class, MODEL_SPECS, model_invocation_counts, historical_model_provenance: principle: Separate current model execution from imported observations; do not apply a generation floor to cached scoring.\nrows, intended_count, completed_count, failed_count, censored_count, excluded_count, independent_count, sample_size_budget: principle: Preserve every intended source/condition/arm with numerator and denominator; repetitions are not independent samples.\nverifier_is_oracle, exposure_scope, independent_generalization_score, generalized_learning_benefit_score: principle: Oracle-defined success is circular_positive. Reused cohorts are exposed development; both generalization scores stay zero.\nrequired_checks_passed, flagged_adversarial, acceptance_gates, validation_receipts, terminal_validation_sidecar_path: principle: Readiness requires owned checks and byte-bound validation; it does not require a scientific win.\npreconditions_checked, duration_s, phase_spans, random_see